                "title": "Laurent Knob with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Laurent Knob with Square Rose is the perfect transitional knobset for your well-decorated home. It blends old and new styles together flawlessly to make something elegant and sleek. The Modern Brass Round Laurent Knobset with Square Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
